INSERT INTO "public"."devotional_days" ("id", "plan_id", "day_number", "content", "title", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('00fe2c44-6e43-445f-ae18-7041f766ef84', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1008', '2', '<p>God''s Word is a stable anchor when emotions and circumstances keep shifting.</p><p>Choose one promise from Scripture today, repeat it in prayer, and let truth shape your response as you pursue contentment and trust.</p>', 'Anchor in Truth', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('01539fd3-a8d1-42e3-8126-9b60dcf004c2', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1006', '3', '<p>Spiritual growth usually happens through small, faithful acts of obedience rather than dramatic moments.</p><p>Take one concrete step today that aligns with listening to God, and trust God to multiply your faithfulness over time.</p>', 'Take One Faithful Step', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('03ebbb57-c2b1-41dc-899f-e92a2bcb61e0', 'bdfac04b-d7a4-4338-80cc-b0dc9c1d7468', '1', '<p><em>Jesus speaks tenderly but firmly to believers who have drifted: “You have forsaken the love you had at first.” Spiritual routine can slowly replace relationship. Remember when prayer felt natural and worship felt alive. Jesus invites you not into guilt, but into restoration. Reflect on what has crowded Him out and take a small step back toward intimacy today.</em></p>', 'Remember Where You Started', '2026-02-16 16:49:57.907054+00', '2026-02-16 16:49:57.907054+00'), ('03f3a6a4-c042-4d40-9bf2-4c190a5590ff', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1003', '3', '<p>Spiritual growth usually happens through small, faithful acts of obedience rather than dramatic moments.</p><p>Take one concrete step today that aligns with peace over anxiety, and trust God to multiply your faithfulness over time.</p>', 'Take One Faithful Step', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('05a74ab5-2548-417f-8450-e080e673142c', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1005', '3', '<p>Spiritual growth usually happens through small, faithful acts of obedience rather than dramatic moments.</p><p>Take one concrete step today that aligns with daily faithfulness, and trust God to multiply your faithfulness over time.</p>', 'Take One Faithful Step', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('09411ab2-da81-4427-82cd-ee572f74dcaf', '3fca3c7a-87fd-4db2-a99c-95ab2ab4b202', '4', '<p>Pay attention to ordinary mercies today: a conversation, a meal, a moment of quiet, or unexpected help.</p><p>These small gifts are not random; they are reminders that God''s care reaches into daily details.</p>', 'Notice Daily Mercies', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('0c3e7082-b072-44c8-bda4-edb82c90cd6e', '3fca3c7a-87fd-4db2-a99c-95ab2ab4b202', '1', '<p>Begin your day by thanking God for three specific gifts, even if they seem small.</p><p>This practice shifts your attention from what is missing to what grace has already provided in your life.</p>', 'Start with Thanks', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('0cd007fa-8740-4cd6-af24-5ec13d5be65e', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1003', '1', '<p>In Healing from Anxiety, today starts by surrendering your plans, worries, and expectations to God, trusting that He sees the full picture you cannot.</p><p>As you focus on peace over anxiety, name one burden in prayer and intentionally place it in God''s hands before you move into your day.</p>', 'Begin with Surrender', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('0f4ed4a8-2f74-48c6-b2d6-f5a1ff89f305', '4d25c35b-52ef-4e59-b8d3-c9a1ab8ac303', '4', '<p>God renews strength in those who wait on Him, even when their energy feels depleted.</p><p>Hope in Him again today and expect His grace to meet you in weakness with fresh endurance.</p>', 'Renewed Strength', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('11a16bba-459e-42b6-bd2f-d8ca291d8c5e', '68479f74-cb73-4b0f-8a2e-cd3a0f6f9505', '5', '<p>Abiding in Christ is the source of lasting love, steady character, and faithful service.</p><p>Stay connected to Him through prayer and obedience, and let His love overflow into every relationship.</p>', 'Remain in Love', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('1269cccf-3283-4201-a2b6-ffdbc27ede37', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1005', '1', '<p>In Faithful in Small Things, today starts by surrendering your plans, worries, and expectations to God, trusting that He sees the full picture you cannot.</p><p>As you focus on daily faithfulness, name one burden in prayer and intentionally place it in God''s hands before you move into your day.</p>', 'Begin with Surrender', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('12c4d81e-680d-4b9c-83c6-0c3c9282ee86', '53e3d108-9de7-4be0-8d53-15f3737ee404', '5', '<p>True wisdom has a foundation: hearing God''s Word and putting it into practice consistently.</p><p>End today by applying one specific truth you learned, and let obedience turn insight into transformation.</p>', 'Build on God''s Word', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('1468cd11-fff5-40c5-a731-7b8325588a1f', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1009', '4', '<p>Lasting transformation is formed in the hidden places of prayer, reflection, and honest repentance.</p><p>Create intentional margin to be with God, ask for renewal, and let Him strengthen your inner life as you continue in forgiveness and reconciliation.</p>', 'Strengthen Your Inner Life', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('14d088a6-d04e-4307-94bb-43cac3634f50', '2b9ef9c5-3e11-4c52-8d17-9b6ea0c1a101', '5', '<p>Faithful progress is often quiet and small, but God honors steady obedience.</p><p>Take one concrete step forward in hope today, trusting that the Lord leads His people one step at a time.</p>', 'Step Forward with Hope', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('1a855ba8-d774-4a23-968e-eb9e9c844f4e', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1001', '2', '<p>God''s Word is a stable anchor when emotions and circumstances keep shifting.</p><p>Choose one promise from Scripture today, repeat it in prayer, and let truth shape your response as you pursue prayer and surrender.</p>', 'Anchor in Truth', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('1b72bd1d-339c-410e-b639-be89d3a927c7', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e100a', '3', '<p>Spiritual growth usually happens through small, faithful acts of obedience rather than dramatic moments.</p><p>Take one concrete step today that aligns with hope for tomorrow, and trust God to multiply your faithfulness over time.</p>', 'Take One Faithful Step', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('1daafa48-1893-46dc-b70f-9e9601a612a1', '68479f74-cb73-4b0f-8a2e-cd3a0f6f9505', '4', '<p>Words carry power to heal or harm, to restore or discourage hearts.</p><p>Choose speech that builds others up, communicates grace, and points people toward hope in God.</p>', 'Speak Life', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('21555f8b-db35-4a6a-bfc7-660446cde952', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1002', '2', '<p>God''s Word is a stable anchor when emotions and circumstances keep shifting.</p><p>Choose one promise from Scripture today, repeat it in prayer, and let truth shape your response as you pursue courage under pressure.</p>', 'Anchor in Truth', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('25a6bee5-26ce-4f2d-9026-85bcecaf21d2', '163b438c-8214-4a0d-a567-dd289b28076f', '1', '<p><em>Paul learned that weakness is not a liability in God’s kingdom. When we feel insufficient, God’s grace becomes sufficient. His power shows up most clearly when we stop pretending we are strong. Bring your limitations to Him — they are invitations for divine strength.</em></p><p><em>God is “an ever-present help in trouble.” Not delayed. Not distant. Present. When storms shake your stability, run toward Him instead of away. Refuge implies safety, but also relationship. He is not only powerful — He is accessible.</em></p>', 'Grace Is Enough', '2026-02-17 11:11:31.563593+00', '2026-02-17 11:11:31.563593+00'), ('268b7d5c-fca2-4c03-a138-01f90ce8998e', '31f0b1f5-d517-4ab2-b370-6739b30f8e05', '1', '<p><em>Anxiety often feels like carrying a heavy backpack filled with “what ifs.” Yet God never intended for us to shoulder those burdens alone. Peter tells us to cast our anxieties on Him — a word that implies throwing something off decisively. God cares personally about what troubles you. Today, instead of rehearsing your fears, practice handing them over in prayer. Name them specifically. Trust that His care is stronger than your worry.</em></p>', 'Casting Your Cares', '2026-02-16 16:44:45.207647+00', '2026-02-16 16:44:45.207647+00'), ('282738d4-ca69-42d4-ab7f-2c1933fdbd77', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1006', '5', '<p>Hope is not wishful thinking; it is confidence in God''s character and promises.</p><p>As this plan closes, carry one truth from Hearing God in Scripture into the week ahead and keep walking forward with steady trust.</p>', 'Walk Forward in Hope', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('2af14cc5-cd99-4167-bf5c-56a54f0d31fb', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1008', '5', '<p>Hope is not wishful thinking; it is confidence in God''s character and promises.</p><p>As this plan closes, carry one truth from Contentment in Every Season into the week ahead and keep walking forward with steady trust.</p>', 'Walk Forward in Hope', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('33a177a1-39bf-48e9-943e-d58d71466889', '3fca3c7a-87fd-4db2-a99c-95ab2ab4b202', '5', '<p>Let gratitude become a rhythm you practice consistently, not only a reaction when life is easy.</p><p>Carry thanksgiving into prayer, relationships, and service so your daily life becomes a testimony of God''s goodness.</p>', 'Live a Thankful Life', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('33c3dd8a-563b-4674-9b5b-dd28332bd608', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1007', '2', '<p>God''s Word is a stable anchor when emotions and circumstances keep shifting.</p><p>Choose one promise from Scripture today, repeat it in prayer, and let truth shape your response as you pursue identity in Christ.</p>', 'Anchor in Truth', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('3bd63e28-a27c-490d-b578-b47811712324', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1001', '5', '<p>Hope is not wishful thinking; it is confidence in God''s character and promises.</p><p>As this plan closes, carry one truth from Prayer That Changes You into the week ahead and keep walking forward with steady trust.</p>', 'Walk Forward in Hope', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('3bfd6a15-21c8-450b-8200-2f655b04f4da', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1001', '3', '<p>Spiritual growth usually happens through small, faithful acts of obedience rather than dramatic moments.</p><p>Take one concrete step today that aligns with prayer and surrender, and trust God to multiply your faithfulness over time.</p>', 'Take One Faithful Step', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('3f73f4f9-596c-4f9f-915c-1363a5e8f545', '68479f74-cb73-4b0f-8a2e-cd3a0f6f9505', '2', '<p>Love is made visible through practical service, not just sincere intention.</p><p>Look for one concrete way to serve someone today with joy, humility, and no need for recognition.</p>', 'Serve with Joy', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('47476c10-97ae-4803-ac9d-f096f3b46ded', '3d5704ea-4efe-415b-9cf3-3c58a39272a9', '2', '<p>Forgiveness is not excusing wrong; it is releasing the right to retaliate. God’s forgiveness toward us sets the standard. Remember how freely you’ve been forgiven. Let that awareness soften your heart toward others.</p>', 'Forgive as You’ve Been Forgiven', '2026-02-17 16:30:31.631436+00', '2026-02-17 16:30:31.631436+00'), ('4bafcf99-2957-4f49-89ae-a54623d7c020', '53e3d108-9de7-4be0-8d53-15f3737ee404', '3', '<p>Wisdom is not merely insight; it is practical obedience to what is right.</p><p>Choose integrity over convenience today, trusting that God honors faithful decisions made in private and public.</p>', 'Choose the Better Path', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('4bdfe690-8f3d-4af2-bab0-cf7c337f62bd', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1003', '5', '<p>Hope is not wishful thinking; it is confidence in God''s character and promises.</p><p>As this plan closes, carry one truth from Healing from Anxiety into the week ahead and keep walking forward with steady trust.</p>', 'Walk Forward in Hope', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('5091998b-3ab5-451a-8cfc-510775c2a990', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1008', '1', '<p>In Contentment in Every Season, today starts by surrendering your plans, worries, and expectations to God, trusting that He sees the full picture you cannot.</p><p>As you focus on contentment and trust, name one burden in prayer and intentionally place it in God''s hands before you move into your day.</p>', 'Begin with Surrender', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('53461fc3-2463-45e6-a88f-c398b63d47d3', '53e3d108-9de7-4be0-8d53-15f3737ee404', '4', '<p>Humility protects wisdom from becoming pride and keeps your heart teachable.</p><p>Invite correction without defensiveness and remain open before God, who shapes mature character over time.</p>', 'Walk in Humility', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('5bc86a73-dbfc-46c3-996d-cf26b6d427bc', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1005', '4', '<p>Lasting transformation is formed in the hidden places of prayer, reflection, and honest repentance.</p><p>Create intentional margin to be with God, ask for renewal, and let Him strengthen your inner life as you continue in daily faithfulness.</p>', 'Strengthen Your Inner Life', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('6442b55c-22f3-40bb-9d27-3fd7533db2c5', '3d5704ea-4efe-415b-9cf3-3c58a39272a9', '1', '<p>Biblical love is not just emotion — it is patience, kindness, and perseverance. This kind of love requires surrendering pride and choosing grace. Ask God to reveal where impatience or resentment has crept in. Love grows strongest when rooted in humility.</p>', 'Love in Action', '2026-02-17 16:30:31.631436+00', '2026-02-17 16:30:31.631436+00'), ('6454473b-d7dd-4ed6-90fd-0c12b6f9caf9', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1005', '2', '<p>God''s Word is a stable anchor when emotions and circumstances keep shifting.</p><p>Choose one promise from Scripture today, repeat it in prayer, and let truth shape your response as you pursue daily faithfulness.</p>', 'Anchor in Truth', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('67cd260e-947b-42cb-964b-299c0f4be7c8', '2b9ef9c5-3e11-4c52-8d17-9b6ea0c1a101', '3', '<p>You do not need tomorrow''s strength for today; God gives daily bread for the present moment.</p><p>Receive His peace, guidance, and courage for this day, and resist the pressure to carry burdens He has not assigned yet.</p>', 'Peace for Today', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('68bc35b4-8979-4111-b18e-5f7916cf664c', '53e3d108-9de7-4be0-8d53-15f3737ee404', '2', '<p>Wisdom shows up in patient listening before quick reactions and careless words.</p><p>In one conversation today, practice listening fully, asking thoughtful questions, and responding with gentleness.</p>', 'Listen Before You Speak', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('69b2c63e-ec8c-4e32-b01d-470c59b48ae0', 'd41fb2ab-636e-40ee-9d10-b37db52d1211', '2', '<p><em>God is faithful to fulfill His promises. Waiting tests whether we trust the Promise-Giver more than the promise itself. Hold firmly to hope, even when circumstances delay visible results. The God who began a good work will finish it in His time.</em></p>', 'Promise Fulfilled', '2026-02-16 20:44:56.411838+00', '2026-02-16 20:44:56.411838+00'), ('6b4624a6-b75a-4929-b52c-86dabcf34391', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1004', '3', '<p>Spiritual growth usually happens through small, faithful acts of obedience rather than dramatic moments.</p><p>Take one concrete step today that aligns with eternal perspective, and trust God to multiply your faithfulness over time.</p>', 'Take One Faithful Step', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('6bc8b169-9ff9-4d44-872b-ab8e23c42f20', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1003', '2', '<p>God''s Word is a stable anchor when emotions and circumstances keep shifting.</p><p>Choose one promise from Scripture today, repeat it in prayer, and let truth shape your response as you pursue peace over anxiety.</p>', 'Anchor in Truth', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('6efd090c-786d-4428-82d5-eac4cded6fe3', '4d25c35b-52ef-4e59-b8d3-c9a1ab8ac303', '5', '<p>Rest is not wasted time; it is part of faithful discipleship and long-term fruitfulness.</p><p>Guard rhythms that restore your soul so your life remains rooted, healthy, and attentive to God.</p>', 'Guard Your Rest', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('6f89fd03-ca67-4df0-b454-7fb41f7a60ea', '3d5704ea-4efe-415b-9cf3-3c58a39272a9', '3', '<p>Jesus said love would identify His followers. In a divided world, sacrificial love stands out. Loving like Christ means choosing compassion over convenience and service over self-interest. Let your relationships today reflect the grace you have received.</p>', 'Reflecting Christ Daily', '2026-02-17 16:30:31.631436+00', '2026-02-17 16:30:31.631436+00'), ('707c4504-baee-4522-bf3a-ca4f1701d8f4', '68479f74-cb73-4b0f-8a2e-cd3a0f6f9505', '3', '<p>Forgiveness is costly, but it reflects the gospel you have received through Christ.</p><p>Ask God for strength to release offense, pray honestly for healing, and choose freedom over bitterness.</p>', 'Forgive as You Were Forgiven', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('70a6190f-ddda-4a6f-832e-ec1d33133e64', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1009', '5', '<p>Hope is not wishful thinking; it is confidence in God''s character and promises.</p><p>As this plan closes, carry one truth from The Way of Forgiveness into the week ahead and keep walking forward with steady trust.</p>', 'Walk Forward in Hope', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('71628864-5136-4ff6-9b5d-9270cfa9aa67', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1001', '4', '<p>Lasting transformation is formed in the hidden places of prayer, reflection, and honest repentance.</p><p>Create intentional margin to be with God, ask for renewal, and let Him strengthen your inner life as you continue in prayer and surrender.</p>', 'Strengthen Your Inner Life', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('7414b257-96e2-47ee-83a4-a76cdcdab8e0', '163b438c-8214-4a0d-a567-dd289b28076f', '2', '<p><em>“The joy of the Lord is your strength.” Joy rooted in God’s character outlasts temporary hardships. Even in rebuilding seasons, joy sustains endurance. Today, meditate on who God is — faithful, sovereign, loving — and let that truth strengthen you.</em></p>', 'Strength Renewed', '2026-02-17 11:11:31.563593+00', '2026-02-17 11:11:31.563593+00'), ('7553daef-aa98-4aa3-8003-02898624d960', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1006', '2', '<p>God''s Word is a stable anchor when emotions and circumstances keep shifting.</p><p>Choose one promise from Scripture today, repeat it in prayer, and let truth shape your response as you pursue listening to God.</p>', 'Anchor in Truth', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('770e297b-9de5-44b5-977a-2ccdefaf0329', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1002', '1', '<p>In Courage in Everyday Battles, today starts by surrendering your plans, worries, and expectations to God, trusting that He sees the full picture you cannot.</p><p>As you focus on courage under pressure, name one burden in prayer and intentionally place it in God''s hands before you move into your day.</p>', 'Begin with Surrender', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('7d8c3832-bf97-4eba-ab6b-d694e5f9dea6', '4d25c35b-52ef-4e59-b8d3-c9a1ab8ac303', '1', '<p>Jesus welcomes the weary, not the perfect, and invites you to come exactly as you are.</p><p>Bring your burdens honestly before Him today and receive His compassion instead of carrying everything alone.</p>', 'Come to Jesus', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('8198c740-55e4-46f1-9a7f-e8ca741e0b5b', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1009', '2', '<p>God''s Word is a stable anchor when emotions and circumstances keep shifting.</p><p>Choose one promise from Scripture today, repeat it in prayer, and let truth shape your response as you pursue forgiveness and reconciliation.</p>', 'Anchor in Truth', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('86828418-87f0-465f-986c-9d67767511f7', '4d25c35b-52ef-4e59-b8d3-c9a1ab8ac303', '3', '<p>True rest includes margin for silence, stillness, and listening to God without hurry.</p><p>Create a brief pause today to sit with Scripture and let His voice steady your thoughts.</p>', 'Slow Down and Listen', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('94f2a6f8-3667-417f-871a-e9160e43d755', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1005', '5', '<p>Hope is not wishful thinking; it is confidence in God''s character and promises.</p><p>As this plan closes, carry one truth from Faithful in Small Things into the week ahead and keep walking forward with steady trust.</p>', 'Walk Forward in Hope', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('a0662163-d200-45a6-8d3f-4c3e467c66e3', '3fca3c7a-87fd-4db2-a99c-95ab2ab4b202', '3', '<p>Your words shape the atmosphere of your heart and the people around you.</p><p>Choose speech that honors God, encourages others, and reflects the hope you carry in Christ.</p>', 'Praise with Your Words', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('a37c3847-6f60-4bf8-a39e-1b7cb2457938', '68479f74-cb73-4b0f-8a2e-cd3a0f6f9505', '1', '<p>We love because God first loved us with initiative, mercy, and sacrifice.</p><p>Receive His love deeply today so your care for others flows from fullness instead of exhaustion.</p>', 'Loved by God First', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('a56fcd17-3f3c-469b-af2d-9bd2e2602679', 'bdfac04b-d7a4-4338-80cc-b0dc9c1d7468', '3', '<p><em>We love because He first loved us. Spiritual renewal begins with remembering that God’s love for you has never cooled. Even when your passion wavers, His remains steady. Let His initiating love awaken your response. Worship is not performance; it is gratitude for grace.</em></p>', 'Love That Responds', '2026-02-16 16:49:57.907054+00', '2026-02-16 16:49:57.907054+00'), ('ab18befa-a272-4161-b7ae-d1d2f86e65e9', '53e3d108-9de7-4be0-8d53-15f3737ee404', '1', '<p>Wisdom begins with dependence on God, not confidence in your own understanding.</p><p>Ask Him openly for discernment in your decisions, and trust that He gives guidance generously.</p>', 'Ask God for Wisdom', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('afcf890f-8d9e-4d76-a0f7-43dc1bb75dd7', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1006', '4', '<p>Lasting transformation is formed in the hidden places of prayer, reflection, and honest repentance.</p><p>Create intentional margin to be with God, ask for renewal, and let Him strengthen your inner life as you continue in listening to God.</p>', 'Strengthen Your Inner Life', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('b56d96aa-4663-480c-8182-bf216d8c3e14', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e100a', '4', '<p>Lasting transformation is formed in the hidden places of prayer, reflection, and honest repentance.</p><p>Create intentional margin to be with God, ask for renewal, and let Him strengthen your inner life as you continue in hope for tomorrow.</p>', 'Strengthen Your Inner Life', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('b588e124-f0be-4d71-98c6-c4042acc4007', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1008', '4', '<p>Lasting transformation is formed in the hidden places of prayer, reflection, and honest repentance.</p><p>Create intentional margin to be with God, ask for renewal, and let Him strengthen your inner life as you continue in contentment and trust.</p>', 'Strengthen Your Inner Life', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('b72690f7-533b-4289-a4bd-96c6578f1680', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1001', '1', '<p>In Prayer That Changes You, today starts by surrendering your plans, worries, and expectations to God, trusting that He sees the full picture you cannot.</p><p>As you focus on prayer and surrender, name one burden in prayer and intentionally place it in God''s hands before you move into your day.</p>', 'Begin with Surrender', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('b80b5331-1b51-401c-9014-e795707379a5', '2b9ef9c5-3e11-4c52-8d17-9b6ea0c1a101', '4', '<p>Look back and remember where God has sustained you in past seasons of uncertainty.</p><p>Let gratitude for His faithfulness strengthen your confidence today, reminding your heart that He has not changed.</p>', 'Remember Past Faithfulness', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('b818ccf1-0b37-4c2e-ae3c-d9b177f83fb3', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1007', '1', '<p>In Freedom from Comparison, today starts by surrendering your plans, worries, and expectations to God, trusting that He sees the full picture you cannot.</p><p>As you focus on identity in Christ, name one burden in prayer and intentionally place it in God''s hands before you move into your day.</p>', 'Begin with Surrender', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('ba15fc89-3a6d-46e6-81a2-d3c086ec7757', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1007', '4', '<p>Lasting transformation is formed in the hidden places of prayer, reflection, and honest repentance.</p><p>Create intentional margin to be with God, ask for renewal, and let Him strengthen your inner life as you continue in identity in Christ.</p>', 'Strengthen Your Inner Life', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('bef30c69-a409-4535-8488-dde9173626f3', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1002', '4', '<p>Lasting transformation is formed in the hidden places of prayer, reflection, and honest repentance.</p><p>Create intentional margin to be with God, ask for renewal, and let Him strengthen your inner life as you continue in courage under pressure.</p>', 'Strengthen Your Inner Life', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('c1ebe097-72ff-4f3c-b70b-4b006d844188', '31f0b1f5-d517-4ab2-b370-6739b30f8e05', '3', '<p><em>David describes God as a Shepherd who leads beside still waters and restores the soul. Sheep are naturally anxious animals, yet they rest when they trust their shepherd. Even in “the valley of the shadow,” God’s presence removes fear. You may not control the valley, but you are never walking it alone. Let His nearness quiet your heart today.</em></p>', 'The Shepherd’s Calm', '2026-02-16 16:44:45.207647+00', '2026-02-16 16:44:45.207647+00'), ('c512864f-154d-4326-9509-0aa0bc293a6d', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1007', '5', '<p>Hope is not wishful thinking; it is confidence in God''s character and promises.</p><p>As this plan closes, carry one truth from Freedom from Comparison into the week ahead and keep walking forward with steady trust.</p>', 'Walk Forward in Hope', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('c6a8dc5a-21bf-438d-a8ee-1a873b2e0c8c', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1002', '5', '<p>Hope is not wishful thinking; it is confidence in God''s character and promises.</p><p>As this plan closes, carry one truth from Courage in Everyday Battles into the week ahead and keep walking forward with steady trust.</p>', 'Walk Forward in Hope', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('cd6f7753-d577-44a5-8caa-4926d68da4f0', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e100a', '5', '<p>Hope is not wishful thinking; it is confidence in God''s character and promises.</p><p>As this plan closes, carry one truth from Hope for the Next Chapter into the week ahead and keep walking forward with steady trust.</p>', 'Walk Forward in Hope', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('cd908dd7-4f25-40cb-948d-f216c5322336', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1002', '3', '<p>Spiritual growth usually happens through small, faithful acts of obedience rather than dramatic moments.</p><p>Take one concrete step today that aligns with courage under pressure, and trust God to multiply your faithfulness over time.</p>', 'Take One Faithful Step', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('ce2113c2-8102-4210-91e7-456d6a50d4ce', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1009', '3', '<p>Spiritual growth usually happens through small, faithful acts of obedience rather than dramatic moments.</p><p>Take one concrete step today that aligns with forgiveness and reconciliation, and trust God to multiply your faithfulness over time.</p>', 'Take One Faithful Step', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('d471d6f0-da86-4e5b-b442-073a401cce40', '31f0b1f5-d517-4ab2-b370-6739b30f8e05', '2', '<p><em>Paul doesn’t deny anxiety exists — he gives us a replacement for it. Prayer, thanksgiving, and honest requests open the door for God’s supernatural peace. This peace does not always remove the situation, but it guards our hearts and minds like a soldier at the gate. When anxious thoughts arise, pause and pray before reacting. Gratitude shifts your focus from what could go wrong to what God has already done.</em></p>', 'Peace That Guards', '2026-02-16 16:44:45.207647+00', '2026-02-16 16:44:45.207647+00'), ('d48882da-8311-4e4e-8a40-b908555d4788', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1004', '2', '<p>God''s Word is a stable anchor when emotions and circumstances keep shifting.</p><p>Choose one promise from Scripture today, repeat it in prayer, and let truth shape your response as you pursue eternal perspective.</p>', 'Anchor in Truth', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('d5238ea0-d73b-4da8-a350-670b0191de4b', 'bdfac04b-d7a4-4338-80cc-b0dc9c1d7468', '2', '<p>Fruitfulness doesn’t come from striving but from abiding. A branch separated from the vine withers, not because it tried too little, but because it disconnected. If your faith feels dry, the solution is not more religious activity — it is deeper connection. Spend unhurried time with Christ. Let His words dwell in you again.</p>', 'Abiding in the Vine', '2026-02-16 16:49:57.907054+00', '2026-02-16 16:49:57.907054+00'), ('d64afd3a-9c48-4d21-8e2d-632c8fd12e22', '4d25c35b-52ef-4e59-b8d3-c9a1ab8ac303', '2', '<p>You were never designed to carry every responsibility and fear by your own strength.</p><p>Name your anxieties specifically in prayer and release them to God, trusting His care is stronger than your worry.</p>', 'Release the Burden', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('d6a01522-a8b3-4314-9057-1cb8600f287e', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1003', '4', '<p>Lasting transformation is formed in the hidden places of prayer, reflection, and honest repentance.</p><p>Create intentional margin to be with God, ask for renewal, and let Him strengthen your inner life as you continue in peace over anxiety.</p>', 'Strengthen Your Inner Life', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('d79a9425-b5e1-4217-b040-17e82488e783', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1009', '1', '<p>In The Way of Forgiveness, today starts by surrendering your plans, worries, and expectations to God, trusting that He sees the full picture you cannot.</p><p>As you focus on forgiveness and reconciliation, name one burden in prayer and intentionally place it in God''s hands before you move into your day.</p>', 'Begin with Surrender', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('dc12fc96-59ca-463a-892f-ab4806768617', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e100a', '2', '<p>God''s Word is a stable anchor when emotions and circumstances keep shifting.</p><p>Choose one promise from Scripture today, repeat it in prayer, and let truth shape your response as you pursue hope for tomorrow.</p>', 'Anchor in Truth', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('dc7d2247-5383-425b-a105-7a8b1580ac50', '3fca3c7a-87fd-4db2-a99c-95ab2ab4b202', '2', '<p>Thankfulness is not pretending pain is absent; it is refusing to let pain have the final word.</p><p>In hard seasons, gratitude declares that God is still good, still present, and still at work in unseen ways.</p>', 'Gratitude in Hard Seasons', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('df15ec14-e5a2-47bd-93ae-2201ecb7b62a', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1008', '3', '<p>Spiritual growth usually happens through small, faithful acts of obedience rather than dramatic moments.</p><p>Take one concrete step today that aligns with contentment and trust, and trust God to multiply your faithfulness over time.</p>', 'Take One Faithful Step', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('e17022f0-ac19-42bc-816e-2a12cec42f18', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e100a', '1', '<p>In Hope for the Next Chapter, today starts by surrendering your plans, worries, and expectations to God, trusting that He sees the full picture you cannot.</p><p>As you focus on hope for tomorrow, name one burden in prayer and intentionally place it in God''s hands before you move into your day.</p>', 'Begin with Surrender', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('e7c600ba-327a-4b37-9bc7-bef3ee908fd1', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1007', '3', '<p>Spiritual growth usually happens through small, faithful acts of obedience rather than dramatic moments.</p><p>Take one concrete step today that aligns with identity in Christ, and trust God to multiply your faithfulness over time.</p>', 'Take One Faithful Step', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('eaf9aeb2-fda5-446f-af92-d85b0355b3b9', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1004', '5', '<p>Hope is not wishful thinking; it is confidence in God''s character and promises.</p><p>As this plan closes, carry one truth from Living with Eternal Perspective into the week ahead and keep walking forward with steady trust.</p>', 'Walk Forward in Hope', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('eb7323b3-ec85-4891-8394-5d9e2ce22f6f', 'd41fb2ab-636e-40ee-9d10-b37db52d1211', '1', '<p><em>Waiting often feels like stagnation, yet Scripture says those who wait on the Lord renew their strength. Waiting is not passive resignation — it is active trust. As you wait, God works beneath the surface, strengthening your character and deepening your dependence. Instead of asking “How long?”, ask “What are You shaping in me?”</em></p><p><em>Silence from God does not mean absence. David encourages himself to “be strong and take heart” while waiting. Sometimes growth happens in hidden seasons. Roots grow downward before fruit grows upward. Trust that unseen progress is still progress.</em></p>', 'Waiting with Trust', '2026-02-16 20:44:56.411838+00', '2026-02-16 20:44:56.411838+00'), ('ef317c77-bb93-47b7-b985-8c8100c956a2', '2b9ef9c5-3e11-4c52-8d17-9b6ea0c1a101', '1', '<p>When the future is unclear, remember God is already there before you arrive.</p><p>Name one fear you are carrying today, surrender it to Him in prayer, and ask for grace to take the next faithful step.</p>', 'God Is Present in the Unknown', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00'), ('eff919c2-22e0-4ea5-b5a2-6650f0358319', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1004', '1', '<p>In Living with Eternal Perspective, today starts by surrendering your plans, worries, and expectations to God, trusting that He sees the full picture you cannot.</p><p>As you focus on eternal perspective, name one burden in prayer and intentionally place it in God''s hands before you move into your day.</p>', 'Begin with Surrender', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('f2bea1a7-1827-48b9-a4e5-b9e01274e0e8', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1006', '1', '<p>In Hearing God in Scripture, today starts by surrendering your plans, worries, and expectations to God, trusting that He sees the full picture you cannot.</p><p>As you focus on listening to God, name one burden in prayer and intentionally place it in God''s hands before you move into your day.</p>', 'Begin with Surrender', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('f3e06164-e0c4-4e0a-8b84-e5746785c3ce', '7a1f2b7e-0d21-4b2a-8a01-3a6c8d9e1004', '4', '<p>Lasting transformation is formed in the hidden places of prayer, reflection, and honest repentance.</p><p>Create intentional margin to be with God, ask for renewal, and let Him strengthen your inner life as you continue in eternal perspective.</p>', 'Strengthen Your Inner Life', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00', '2026-03-04 11:52:41.058384+00'), ('fbde41ac-c5d3-40db-8525-0db3f1aa3f21', '2b9ef9c5-3e11-4c52-8d17-9b6ea0c1a101', '2', '<p>Faith often deepens most when certainty fades and control feels out of reach.</p><p>Ask God to help you trust His character above your circumstances, and choose obedience even before every answer is visible.</p>', 'Trust Beyond What You See', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00', '2026-03-03 17:21:14.506976+00');